msgstr "**CI**seadke `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` hoidlamuutuja. GitHubi klõpsu asukohta vaata siit [CI seadistamine](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md#infinito_playwright_keep-)."

