msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Ärge hoiatage ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao hoiab Vaulti meetrilist nimeruumi ja tervislik avamata sõlm kiirgab ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, seega hoiatus ``== 0`` tulekahjud jäädavalt. Kasuta ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 pitseeritud); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` kinnitab."

