# libretranslate
msgid "**Insecure HTTP (v1):** No TLS for the initial implementation; the registry runs on the manager's host network and binds only the address the manager hostname resolves to, so no other interface listens. Each swarm node trusts the manager's `<host>:5000` via `daemon.json.insecure-registries`."
msgstr "**Ebakindel HTTP (v1):** Esmaseks rakendamiseks TLS puudub; register töötab halduri hostvõrgus ja seob ainult aadressi, millele halduri hostinimi otsustab, nii et ükski teine liides ei kuula. Iga sülemsõlm usaldab haldurit `<host>:5000` viadu `daemon.json.insecure-registries`."

# libretranslate
