# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Inventuuri kaustad.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) kõned [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), mis loob ühe kausta vooru kohta `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (või `<inventory-dir>` kui toimub üks ring)Iga kausta jaoks `build_dev_inventory` lahendab vooru ühe rakenduse variandi kasuliku koormuse ja küpsetab selle inventari `host_vars` nagu `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` tühistab. Seetõttu on inventuur kettal variandipõhine; ei ole vaja käitusaja valijat."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory pin**: set `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` in `group_vars` or `host_vars` of the target environment."
msgstr "**Inventuuri tihvt**set : `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` sisse `group_vars` või `host_vars` sihtkeskkonnast."

