# libretranslate
msgid "**Key-file formats** in `HiddenServiceDir`: `hostname` (address + `\\n`), `hs_ed25519_public_key` (`== ed25519v1-public: type0 ==` header + 32-byte key), `hs_ed25519_secret_key` (`== ed25519v1-secret: type0 ==` header + **64-byte expanded** secret key = SHA-512(seed) clamped)."
msgstr "**Võtmefaili vormingud** sisse `HiddenServiceDir`: `hostname` (aadress + `\\n`), `hs_ed25519_public_key` (`== ed25519v1-public: type0 ==` päis + 32Baidivõti), `hs_ed25519_secret_key` (`== ed25519v1-secret: type0 ==` päis + **64- bait laiendatud** salavõti = SHA-512(seemne) klammerdatud)."

