# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Keycloak group → Frappe role mapping** — three tiers: ``roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator`` → ``System Manager``, ``roles/web-app-erpnext/manager`` → ``{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User``, default → ``Customer``. Reconciled on each login by a hook reading the persisted map."
msgstr "**Keycloaki grupp → Frappe rollide kaardistamine** — kolmetasandiline: ``roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator`` → ``System Manager``, ``roles/web-app-erpnext/manager`` → ``{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User``, vaikimisi → ``Customer``. Igal sisselogimisel konksuga, mis loeb püsikaarti."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Keycloak group → Frappe role mapping** — three tiers: `roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator` → `System Manager`, `roles/web-app-erpnext/manager` → `{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User`, default → `Customer`. Reconciled on each login by a hook reading the persisted map."
msgstr "**Keycloaki grupp → Frappe rollide kaardistamine** — kolmetasandiline: `roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator` → `System Manager`, `roles/web-app-erpnext/manager` → `{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User`, vaikimisi → `Customer`. Igal sisselogimisel konksuga, mis loeb püsikaarti."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Keycloaki sisselogimine:** Keycloaki kasutuselevõtuga, rollid ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` ja LiteLLM Gateway loeb platvormi OIDC lõpp-punkte ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` ja ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Registreeru ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` See sisaldab administraatori kasutajanime. LiteLLM teenindab SSO-d kuni viiel kontol ``litellm_usertable`` ja keeldub sellest kaugemale ilma ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets `services.sso.flavor: oidc` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform's OIDC endpoints from `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` and `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Sign in at `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` carries the administrator's username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in `litellm_usertable` and refuses beyond that without `LITELLM_LICENSE`."
msgstr "**Keycloaki sisselogimine:** Keycloaki kasutuselevõtuga, rollid `services.sso.flavor: oidc` ja LiteLLM Gateway loeb platvormi OIDC lõpp-punkte `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` ja `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Registreeru `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` kannab administraatori kasutajanime. LiteLLM teenindab SSO-d kuni viiel kontol `litellm_usertable` ja keeldub sellest kaugemale ilma `LITELLM_LICENSE`."

