msgid "**SSO Login:** “Login with SSO” button (when OIDC is enabled)"
msgstr "**SSO sisselogimine:** Nupp „Logi sisse SSO- ga (kui OIDC on lubatud)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO authentication:** Access is protected by Keycloak via oauth2-proxy."
msgstr "**SSO autentimine:** Juurdepääsu kaitseb Keycloak oauth kaudu2- Proxy."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO flavor is `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NOT native OIDC — because Checkmk Raw has no OIDC. The oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and passes `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk's site Apache trusts it via `auth_by_http_header`. This mirrors [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)'s header-SSO bridge (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."
msgstr "**SSO maitse `oauth2`** (Oauth2- Proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NOT native OIDC – sest Checkmk Raw ei ole OIDC. Oauth2-Proksi autentimine Keycloaki ja passide vastu `X-Remote-User`; Checkmki sait Apache usaldab seda `auth_by_http_header`. Need peeglid [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)päise-SSO sild (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP- gated päise usaldus)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` drives ``/sso/key/generate`` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**SSO edasi-tagasi katse:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` sõidab ``/sso/key/generate`` läbi Keycloaki sisselogimisvormi ja kinnitab, et kasutajaliides ei lange enam tagasi oma parooliväravasse."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** `test-oidc-login.js` drives `/sso/key/generate` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**SSO edasi-tagasi katse:** `test-oidc-login.js` sõidab `/sso/key/generate` läbi Keycloaki sisselogimisvormi ja kinnitab, et kasutajaliides ei lange enam tagasi oma parooliväravasse."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy."
msgstr "**SSO Keycloaki kaudu:** seadistatakse automaatselt esimesel käivitamisel."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted `Remote-Email` header (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); an `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script (`files/hooks.js`, adapted from [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n's own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO kaudu2proksiautomaatse paigaldamisega:** V1 väravad kogu juurdepääsu kaudu jagatud Keycloak OIDC klient (Oauth2puhverserv). openresty edastab autenditud identiteedi8n usaldusväärsena `Remote-Email` päise (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` skript (`files/hooks.js`, kohandatud [PavelSozonov/n8n-kogukond-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) Loeb, et päis, automaatselt ette kohaliku n8n kasutaja esimesel sisselogimisel ja probleemid n8n-i enda seansiküpsis - nii et iga Keycloaki kasutaja maandub otse töövoo redaktorisse, ilma teiseta, n8n-kohalik sisselogimise samm."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted ``Remote-Email`` header (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); an ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script (``files/hooks.js``, adapted from `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n’s own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO kaudu2proksiautomaatse paigaldamisega:** V1 väravad kogu juurdepääsu kaudu jagatud Keycloak OIDC klient (Oauth2puhverserv). openresty edastab autenditud identiteedi8n usaldusväärsena ``Remote-Email`` päise (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` skript (``files/hooks.js``, kohandatud `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) Loeb, et päis, automaatselt ette kohaliku n8n kasutaja esimesel sisselogimisel ja probleemid n8n-i enda seansiküpsis - nii et iga Keycloaki kasutaja maandub otse töövoo redaktorisse, ilma teiseta, n8n-kohalik sisselogimise samm."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall's SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to `/saml/acs` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak's realm descriptor by [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a `.onion` issuer is unresolvable directly. `/auth` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** on SuiteCRM-i enda SAML-i sisselogimine Keycloaki vastu (`sso.flavor: saml` sisse [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), mitte proksi selle ees. Autenteerimata taotlused tabasid Symfony tulemüüri SAML-i sisenemispunkti, mis suunab ümber Keycloakile; väide tuleb tagasi `/saml/acs` ja loob tõelise SuiteCRM seansi, nii et rakendus esitab oma autenditud kasutajaliidese, sealhulgas selle väljalogimise kontrolli. Kontod luuakse väitest esimesel sisselogimisel (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`)ja IdP allkirjastamise sertifikaati loetakse Keycloaki riigikirjeldusest [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) alglaadimisel üle Tor SOCKS puhverserveri, kui väljaandja on sibul, sest `.onion` emitent ei ole otseselt lahendatav. `/auth` jääb ligipääsetavaks kohaliku murdeklaasi sisselogimisena."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM’s own SAML login against Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** on SuiteCRM-i enda SAML-i sisselogimine Keycloaki vastu (``sso.flavor: saml`` sisse ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` jääb ligipääsetavaks kohaliku murdeklaasi sisselogimisena."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO-Ready:** SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak, configured declaratively from the rendered env 🌐"
msgstr "**SSO-Ready:** SuiteCRMi enda SAML sisselogimine Keycloaki vastu, konfigureeritud deklaratiivselt renderdatud env 🌐"

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO-Ready:** SuiteCRM’s own SAML login against Keycloak, configured declaratively from the rendered env 🌐"
