# libretranslate
msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Hermese agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT)Isemajandav `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` taustaprogrammid pluss konteineri kõvenemine. Laevad ametlik veebi armatuurlaud **isesaatev OIDC** auth (sobib platvormi SSO-ga), delegaadid töötavad **isoleeritud subaktiivid**, omab püsivat mälu, ajakava, visiooniveebi sirvimist ja MCP tuge (**klient alates0.2.0, server alates v0.6.0**). `web-app-hermes`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (avatud lähtekoodiga, npm/pnpm)Sisseehitatud Gateway veebi armatuurlaud (vaikimisi `18789`) pluss CLI / TUI, brauseri juhtimine, failisüsteemi liivakast, püsiv mälu, oskused / pluginad ja native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, nii klient kui ka server). `web-app-openclaw`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** Seadke (või `full_cycle=true` peal `make compose-deploy`), ümbris käivitab iga vooru kaks korda: kõigepealt tavaline sünkroonimine, seejärel kohe teine läbimine `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` tühistab host_var, vastu sama variandi kausta, ENNE järgmisse ringi liikumist. Seetõttu paiknevad kaks läbipääsu alati ühes ja samas vastuvõtjariigis; async pass ei võta kunagi juhuslikult sihikule võõrustajat, kelle eelmise vooru variant maha jättis."

