# libretranslate
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr "**`deny`** (tähtsusjärjekord 1): Struktuurselt hävitavad kujundid on blokeeritud otse, isegi kui liivakasti. Hõlmab kesta silmuseid (`for`/`while`/`until`), ristrepo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privilegeeritud `gh` tegusõnu (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`)ja mutatsiooni `gh api` tegusõnu (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge rajad)."

