# libretranslate
msgid "**`docker exec` is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NEVER invoke `docker exec` (nor nested `docker exec … docker exec …` into the DiD stack) directly. Always reach the live stack through `make` targets (e.g. `make compose-exec`, or the role-specific targets the `Makefile` exposes). If no `make` target covers what you need, ask the operator instead of falling back to raw `docker exec`."
msgstr "**`docker exec` on keelatud.** Sa ei pea kunagi helistama `docker exec` (pesitsenud `docker exec … docker exec …` DiD virna) otse. Alati jõuda live virna läbi `make` sihtmärgid (nt. `make compose-exec`, või rollispetsiifilised eesmärgid `Makefile` paljastab)Kui ei. `make` Sihtmärk katab, mida vajate, küsige operaatorilt selle asemel, et toorelt tagasi langeda `docker exec`."

