msgid "**architecture** -- which CPU architecture the row deploys on, and through :func:`utils.github.variant.pools.runner_of` which runner it lands on. It rotates on the position directly rather than as a further odometer digit: two values against five distros and fifteen distro/filesystem positions are coprime with both, so walking it fastest still reaches every pairing, while making it the slowest digit would hand a role with few rows a single architecture forever. A role may narrow the pool to one value in ``meta/services.yml`` when only that hardware can run it."
