# libretranslate
msgid "**dual-family providers** — the one real remaining design gap. On a CI onion node, tor-enabled providers (e.g. mastodon) are onion-exclusive: their domain list contains only the `.onion` canonical, no clearnet sibling. The family-alignment resolver (`utils/tls_common.py:align_domain_to_consumer`, wired into `plugins/lookup/tls.py`) correctly bails in that case, so a clearnet-pinned consumer still receives an onion URL it can neither resolve nor reach. First hard evidence: `web-app-fediwall` variant 2 (tor=false) renders `microblog.<onion>` into `wall-config.json.servers`; the clearnet browser (no SOCKS) times out waiting for mastodon wall items (`test-walls-surface-posts.js:24`, deterministic across retries). The same class is expected to keep `web-app-bigbluebutton`, `web-app-nextcloud`, `web-app-opentalk` and `web-app-jitsi` red (clearnet-pinned apps whose peer refs — OIDC/cdn/matomo/logout — resolve onion-primary). Fix direction: providers must publish BOTH families (clearnet sibling alongside the onion canonical) so the resolver has something to align to; includes re-applying the deferred `KC_HOSTNAME` onion-gate for Keycloak that was dropped from the earlier bundle because it is only needed once dual-family exists."
msgstr "**kahepereteenuse osutajad** – üks tõeline järelejäänud disainilünk. Infrastruktuuriga sibulasõlmel tor-toega tarnijad (nt mastodon) Sibul on eksklusiivne: nende domeeninimekiri sisaldab ainult `.onion` Kanooniline, ilma selgevõrgu õe-vennata. Perekonnaga vastavusse viimise lahendaja (`utils/tls_common.py:align_domain_to_consumer`, ühendatud `plugins/lookup/tls.py`) Sellisel juhul kautsjon õigesti, nii et Clearnet-pinned tarbija saab endiselt sibula URL-i, mida see ei suuda lahendada ega jõuda. Esimesed kindlad tõendid: `web-app-fediwall` variant 2 (tor=vale) renderdab `microblog.<onion>` sisse `wall-config.json.servers`; Clearneti brauser (SOCKS) Mastodoni seinaesemete ootamine (`test-walls-surface-posts.js:24`, deterministlik kõigis korduskatsetes)Sama klass peaks jääma `web-app-bigbluebutton`, `web-app-nextcloud`, `web-app-opentalk` ja `web-app-jitsi` punane (Clearnet-pinned rakendused, mille peer refs - OIDC/cdn/matomo/logout — sibula esmalahus)Fix suund: pakkujad peavad avaldama mõlemad perekonnad (Clearnet õde-vend sibulakanoonilise kõrval) Nii et lahendajal on midagi joonduda; sealhulgas edasilükatud `KC_HOSTNAME` Sibulvärav Keycloakile, mis eelmisest kimbust välja visati, sest seda on vaja ainult siis, kui kahekordne perekond on olemas."

