# libretranslate
msgid "Adding configuration for a plugin"
msgstr "Plugina seadistuste lisamine"

# libretranslate
msgid "Adding entries here widens the agent's effective write scope. New paths SHOULD be justified against the same standard as the existing three (required for normal workflow, no sensitive content, narrow as possible)."
msgstr "Kirjete lisamine laiendab agendi efektiivset kirjutamisulatust. Uued teed PEAVAD olema õigustatud sama standardi alusel kui olemasolevad kolm (vajalik tavalise töövoo jaoks, ilma tundliku sisuta, võimalikult kitsas)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Adding this role to a device switches the agent from isolated to embodied. The agent then receives exactly the devices listed in `ROBOT_DEVICE_ALLOWLIST` and nothing else, and the kernel-isolating runtime is dropped, because a microVM between the agent and hardware it is supposed to drive defeats the purpose. The trust boundary moves outward to the machine, but only as far as the listed devices: the container is not privileged, so a device that is not on the list is not reachable, and a lint keeps it that way."
msgstr "Selle rolli lisamine seadmele lülitab agendi isoleeritud kehasse. Seejärel saab agent täpselt loetletud seadmed. `ROBOT_DEVICE_ALLOWLIST` ja ei midagi muud ja kernelit isoleeriv tööaeg langeb, sest mikroVM agendi ja riistvara vahel, mida see peaks sõitma, kaotab eesmärgi. Usalduspiir liigub masinasse väljapoole, kuid ainult loetletud seadmeteni: konteiner ei ole privilegeeritud, nii et seade, mis ei ole nimekirjas, ei ole ligipääsetav ja lint hoiab seda nii."

# libretranslate
msgid "Adding this role to a device switches the agent from isolated to embodied. The agent then receives exactly the devices listed in ``ROBOT_DEVICE_ALLOWLIST`` and nothing else, and the kernel-isolating runtime is dropped, because a microVM between the agent and hardware it is supposed to drive defeats the purpose. The trust boundary moves outward to the machine, but only as far as the listed devices: the container is not privileged, so a device that is not on the list is not reachable, and a lint keeps it that way."
msgstr "Selle rolli lisamine seadmele lülitab agendi isoleeritud kehasse. Seejärel saab agent täpselt loetletud seadmed. ``ROBOT_DEVICE_ALLOWLIST`` ja ei midagi muud ja kernelit isoleeriv tööaeg langeb, sest mikroVM agendi ja riistvara vahel, mida see peaks sõitma, kaotab eesmärgi. Usalduspiir liigub masinasse väljapoole, kuid ainult loetletud seadmeteni: konteiner ei ole privilegeeritud, nii et seade, mis ei ole nimekirjas, ei ole ligipääsetav ja lint hoiab seda nii."

