msgstr "Samuti käsitsi väljasaadetav: `cron-images-mirror-all.yml`, `cron-images-cleanup-ci.yml`, `cron-cleanup-stale.yml`, `cron-update.yml`, `cron-release-highest.yml`, `call-release-version.yml`, `call-lint.yml`, `call-test.yml`, `call-test-dns.yml`, `call-test-workspace.yml`, `call-test-runner-smoke.yml`."

