# libretranslate
msgid "Biber is blocked by `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, which this role sets to true in `vars/main.yml`: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is either auto-login off, or a deploy step that promotes the OIDC-provisioned administrator account to sysop."
msgstr "Biber on blokeeritud `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, mida see roll täidab `vars/main.yml`: iga anonüümne taotlus põrgatakse otse tagasi identiteedi pakkujasse, nii et kontrollitud autentimata maandumist pärast rakendusesisest väljalogimist, mida persona leping nõuab, ei saa siin kunagi jälgida. Tee tagasi geneeriliste isikute juurde on kas automaatne sisselogimine välja või juurutamise samm, mis reklaamib OIDC-i poolt pakutavat administraatori kontot sysop'iks."

# libretranslate
msgid "Biber is blocked by ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin``, which this role sets to true in ``vars/main.yml``: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is either auto-login off, or a deploy step that promotes the OIDC-provisioned administrator account to sysop."
