# libretranslate
msgid "Client to adapter: ``credentials.mcp_bearer``, owned by ``mcp-web-app-baserow``. The adapter refuses any request that does not present it, so a caller on the container network is no longer implicitly trusted."
msgstr "Klient adapterile: ``credentials.mcp_bearer``, mis kuulub ``mcp-web-app-baserow``. Adapter keeldub mis tahes päringust, mis seda ei esita, nii et konteinervõrgu helistajat ei usaldata enam kaudselt."

# libretranslate
