# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Ristteenusega sondid (biber keelatud prometheus, biber keelatud matomo, armatuurlaua plaatide ligipääsetavus) Nad ei kuulu per-roll biber persona hulka. Nad elavad pakkuja enda spetsifikaadis (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), mida parameetritakse üks kord teenuseosutaja `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. Armatuurlaua puhul delegeerib parameetriline stsenaarium `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, millele kuulub plaatide nähtavus / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out väited ühes SPOT-is."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Ristteenuse sondid EI OLE osa rolli administraatori isikust. Armatuurlaua plaatide ligipääsetavus kuulub `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, mis delegeerib iga sihtorgani `runDashboardCardScenario` abiline `dashboard-card-flow.js` (plaat nähtav → klõps laadib `#main iframe` → päis \"Tab\" nupp avab manuse värske brauseri kaardile). See abimees on armatuurlaua-plaadi mehaanika SPOT; tarbijanäitajad EI TOHI ühtegi neist väidetest uuesti rakendada. Prometheus admin-reach ja scrape parity kuuluvad `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach ja tracker kohaloleku omanik `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Iga pakkuja parameetriseerib väite oma `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Ristkasutuspinna kinnitused (armatuurlaua plaatide ligipääsetavus, prometheus admin-reach ja kraapimispariteet, matomo admin-reach ja tracker olemasolu, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) Need kuuluvad pakkuja enda spetsifikaatidele. Iga pakkuja parameetriseerib väite tema kohta `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesti `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Tarbijarollide isikud ei tohi neid sonde dubleerida."

