# libretranslate
msgid "Direct-probe deny-checks MUST validate the response body, not only the status code. A `200 OK` is acceptable ONLY when the body contains provider-specific markers proving the response is the genuine provider surface. For prometheus, the markers are `prometheus_build_info` or `<title>Prometheus</title>`. For matomo, the markers are matomo's login-form markers or `piwik` and `matomo` strings in the body. Any 200 with a non-matching body is treated as a misconfigured proxy or a denial-as-200 surface and fails loudly. The deny-checks live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` and `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)."
msgstr "Otsese sondi keelamise kontroll peab kinnitama reageerimisorgani, mitte ainult olekukoodi. A `200 OK` on vastuvõetav AINULT siis, kui keha sisaldab teenuseosutajale eriomaseid markereid, mis tõendavad, et vastus on pakkuja tegelik pind. Prometheuse puhul on markerid `prometheus_build_info` või `<title>Prometheus</title>`. Matomo puhul on markerid matomo sisselogimisvormi markerid või `piwik` ja `matomo` nöörid kehas. Iga 200 mittesobiva kehaga käsitletakse valesti seadistatud proksi või eitus-as-200 pinnale ja puruneb valjult. Keeldumiskontrollid elavad pakkuja enda spetsifikatsioonis (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` ja `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Direction"
msgstr "Suund"

# libretranslate
msgid "Direction gates the wiring: a `server` role only exposes `/mcp`, a `client` role only consumes, a `both` role does either. Implementation precedence is `native > plugin > sidecar > external`; a `sidecar`/`external` server gets its own service entry and port rather than reusing the app's primary HTTP port."
msgstr "Suund sulgeb juhtmestiku: a `server` roll paljastab `/mcp`, `client` roll ainult tarbib, a `both` roll samuti. Rakendamise prioriteet on `native > plugin > sidecar > external`; `sidecar`/`external` server saab oma teenuse sisenemise ja porti, selle asemel et uuesti kasutada rakenduse peamist HTTP-porti."

