#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumendid `services.matomo.track: false` loobumine `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Roll püsib `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (nii et rollijuhtme leping jääb rahule) aga `roles_with_service('matomo')` pillab `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` ja matomojälgija e2Lepingut. Reserveeritud staatiliste failide jaoks (autoindeks) ja 301Redirect vhosts, mis ei sisalda kasutajale suunatud HTML-lehte, mis on väärt `_paq` jälitaja. Marker on kaasas `track:` andmete lipuga."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumendid `services.prometheus.scrape: false` loobumine `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Roll püsib `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (nii et rollijuhtme leping jääb rahule) aga `roles_with_service('prometheus')` pillab `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. reserveeritud 301- ainult suunavad vhostid, mis ei teeni kunagi palvet lua-resty-prometheuse kaudu, nii et nad ei eralda `app=\"<role>\"` märgistada ja pole kriimustatud sihtmärki. Marker on kaasas `scrape:` andmete lipuga."

# libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Dokumendid `unsafe-*: true` lipu `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. PEAB olema paaris `Reason:` Samal joonel nimetades, mis puruneb ilma lõõgastuseta. `unsafe-inline` taaskinnitab XSS-i poolt vajaliku inline täitmise ja `unsafe-eval` taaslubab string-to-code'i, nii et lippu tuleb kontrollida jooksva rakendusega, mitte kopeerida teisest rollist."

