# libretranslate
msgid "Extend the `roles_with_service` lookup for `direction` filtering and endpoint metadata so client roles can discover servers."
msgstr "Laienda `roles_with_service` otsing `direction` filtreerimine ja lõpp-punkti metaandmed, et kliendi rollid saaksid servereid leida."

# libretranslate
msgid "Extend the provisioned test inventory with host-topology placements plus the dep-walked ``placement: manager`` set, so the static validator (running before ansible) finds every group the swarm deploy will use."
msgstr "Laiendada ette nähtud testide loendit host-topoloogia paigutustega pluss dep-walked ``placement: manager`` seadistatud, nii et staatiline validaator (enne anible'i) leiab kõik rühmad, mida sülem kasutab."

# libretranslate
msgid "Extended Docker image version handling to support ghcr.io, depth-aware comparisons, and flavored semver tags such as 5.4.5-php8.3-apache"
msgstr "Laiendatud Dockeri pildiversiooni haldamine ghcr.io, sügavusteadlikud võrdlused ja maitsestatud semver-sildid nagu 5.4.5php8.3-Apache"

# libretranslate
msgid "Extended timeout for the flaky *setupSuperUser* step"
msgstr "Pikendatud aegumine kihilise puhul *setupSuperUser* samm"

# libretranslate
msgid "Extensions are declared in [`meta/addons/`](./meta/addons/) under the unified addon contract. Each one is installed through the XWiki Extension Manager and pins its upstream version; the Maven coordinate is carried under the addon's `config.id`:"
msgstr "Laiendused on deklareeritud [`meta/addons/`](./meta/addons/) ühtse lisalepingu alusel. Igaüks neist on installitud XWiki Extension Manageri kaudu ja kinnitab selle ülesvoolu versiooni; Maveni koordinaat kantakse lisandi alla `config.id`:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Extensions are declared in ```meta/addons/`` <./meta/addons/>`__ under the unified addon contract. Each one is installed through the XWiki Extension Manager and pins its upstream version; the Maven coordinate is carried under the addon’s ``config.id``:"
msgstr "Laiendused on deklareeritud ```meta/addons/`` <./meta/addons/>`__ under the unified addon contract. Each one is installed through the XWiki Extension Manager and pins its upstream version; the Maven coordinate is carried under the addon’s ``config.id``:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Extensive deploy and end-to-end hardening, much of it reproduced in Docker-in-Docker: native username and password login fallbacks for the no-SSO admin persona across Akaunting, Snipe-IT, YOURLS and OpenProject; OpenProject linked to the LDAP auth source for header SSO to fix a trusted-header 401, with all rails-runner Ruby extracted to dedicated files under *files/ruby/*; Shopware retries asset and theme builds against a restarting SeaweedFS; Mailu retries user creation and waits for antispam readiness before DKIM keygen; YOURLS creates its database schema on deploy; and OpenProject boots db:migrate under Ruby 4.0."
msgstr "Ulatuslik juurutamine ja otsast lõpuni kõvendamine, millest suur osa reprodutseeriti Docker-in-Dockeris: kohalik kasutajanimi ja parooli sisselogimise varuvariandid no-SSO admin persona jaoks Akauntingis, Snipe-ITs, YOURLSis ja OpenProjectis; OpenProject, mis on seotud LDAP auth allikaga päise SSO jaoks, et määrata usaldusväärne päis 401, kusjuures kõik rööpad-jooksja Ruby eraldatakse spetsiaalsetesse failidesse *failid/ruby*; Shopware uuesti proovida vara ja teema ehitab vastu taaskäivitamise SeaweedFS; Mailu uuesti proovida kasutaja loomine ja ootab antispam valmisoleku enne DKIM keygen; YOURLS loob oma andmebaasi skeemi käivitamisel; ja OpenProject boots db: migreerub Ruby all 4.0."

# libretranslate
msgid "External Failures"
msgstr "Välised vead"

# libretranslate
msgid "External Tests 🌐"
msgstr "Välistestid 🌐"

# libretranslate
msgid "External drift and update PRs"
msgstr "Väline triivimine ja PR-de uuendamine"

# libretranslate
msgid "External tests"
msgstr "Väliskatsed"

# libretranslate
msgid "External tests MAY emit warnings instead of hard failures when the goal is advisory freshness reporting rather than merge-blocking correctness."
msgstr "Välistestid VÕIVAD kõvade rikete asemel anda hoiatusi, kui eesmärgiks on nõuandev värskusaruandlus, mitte ühendamine-blokeerimine."

# libretranslate
msgid "External tests MUST live under `tests/external/`."
msgstr "Välistestid PEAVAD elama allpool `tests/external/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "External tests depend on live third-party systems such as Docker Hub, GHCR, or other external services. Run them with `make test-external`."
msgstr "Välised testid sõltuvad kolmandate osapoolte süsteemidest nagu Docker Hub, GHCR või muud välised teenused. Jookse nendega `make test-external`."

# libretranslate
msgid "External tests run inside `.github/workflows/call-test.yml` via `make test`. It MAY be triggered manually and is intentionally separate from the default `make test` flow. It is also wired into the orchestrated code-testing gate in CI so the live check can run there without changing local default validation."
msgstr "Välised testid toimuvad sees `.github/workflows/call-test.yml` viadu `make test`. Seda võib käivitada käsitsi ja see on vaikimisi vaikimisi tahtlikult eraldatud. `make test` voolu. Samuti on see ühendatud CI-s orkestreeritud koodi testimise väravasse, nii et reaalajas kontroll saab seal töötada ilma kohalikku vaikevalideerimist muutmata."

# libretranslate
msgid "External update monitoring"
msgstr "Väline värskenduse seire"

# libretranslate
msgid "External-service reuse: **`svc-db-mariadb`** for MariaDB (primary DB), **`svc-db-redis`** for all three Frappe Redis logical roles (separated by DB number: `cache=0`, `queue=1`, `socketio=2`). Nginx frontend stays bundled in-role (Frappe-aware reverse-proxy config)."
msgstr "Väliste teenuste taaskasutus: **`svc-db-mariadb`** MariaDB (esmane DB), **`svc-db-redis`** Kõik kolm Frappe Redise loogilist rolli (eraldatud DB-numbriga: `cache=0`, `queue=1`, `socketio=2`)Nginxi kasutajaliides jääb komplekteerituks (Frappe- aware pöördproksi seadistamine)."

# libretranslate
msgid "External: the failure reproduces independently of the current branch and MUST be reported as an issue per [External Failures](#external-failures)."
msgstr "Väline: rike reprodutseeritakse aktiivsest harust sõltumatult ja sellest TULEB teatada emissioonina [Välised vead](#external-failures)."

# libretranslate
