# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Input (env): ``APP_ID``. Optional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (JSON ``{app_id: variant_index}``, set per round by the matrix orchestrator) selects the active variant so a variant that pins ``services.*`` flags to ``false`` prunes those providers from the closure instead of the provision step pulling them in from the variant-free base config. In-process callers that already hold the round map pass it as ``derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)``; the env var is read only when that argument is omitted."
msgstr "Sisend (env): ``APP_ID``. Vabatahtlik ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (JSON ``{app_id: variant_index}``, mille seab maatriksorkestraator) Valib aktiivse variandi nii, et pins ``services.*`` lippe ``false`` ploomid need pakkujad sulgemise asemel säte samm tõmmates neid alates variant-vaba baas seadistamine. Protsessisisesed helistajad, kellel on juba ümmargune kaart, läbivad selle kui ``derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)``; env var. loetakse ainult siis, kui see argument on välja jäetud."

