# libretranslate
msgid "Internal helper role that installs CA-trust injection assets used by Docker Compose stacks. It ships a small wrapper plus the `inject` script and validates that the project CA certificate is present on the host before container builds rely on it."
msgstr "Sisemine abistaja roll, mis paigaldab CA-trusti süstimise varasid, mida kasutavad Docker Compose korstnad. See saadab väikese ümbrise pluss `inject` skript ja kinnitab, et projekti CA sertifikaat on hostil olemas enne, kui konteiner sellele tugineb."

