# libretranslate
msgid "New lint: git branch names are validated against the naming convention. Agent docs gained a hard pre-redeploy verification gate in the role iteration loop."
msgstr "Uus lint: git harunimed on valideeritud vastavalt nimetamiskonventsioonile. Agent Docs sai rolli iteratsiooni ahelas kõva eel-redeploy kontrollivärava."

# libretranslate
msgid "New packaging lint: a *lint-packages* check, wired into *make lint* and its own CI workflow, validates the generated *debian/changelog* with *dpkg-parsechangelog*, the Fedora spec with *rpmspec* and the Arch *PKGBUILD* with a *bash -n* syntax pass, failing on any parser warning rather than only on a non-zero exit. A complementary *test-lint* check asserts that both package changelogs list every released version and that their inline window matches CHANGELOG.md. See [the workflow catalog](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Uus pakendi sisu: a *lintpakendid* tðekk, juhtmega *libista* ja oma CI töövoo valideerib genereeritud *debian/changelog* koos *dpkg- parsechangelog*Fedora spekter *rpmspec* Kaarega *PKGBUILD* koos *bash-n* süntaksipass, mis ei tööta parseri hoiatusel, mitte ainult nullist väljapääsul. Täiendav *testlint* kontroll kinnitab, et mõlemad paketimuudatused loetlevad iga välja antud versiooni ja et nende inline aken sobib CHANGELOG.md. Vaata. [töövoo kataloog](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "New permanent team members should follow the [onboarding document](https://s.infinito.nexus/onboarding)."
msgstr "Uued alalised meeskonnaliikmed peaksid järgima [pardadokument](https://s.infinito.nexus/onboarding)."

