msgstr "Sõlmede baasnimed on SPOT default.env (jagasime scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/topology/base.sh); ainult SWARM_NAME Siin rakendatakse prefiksi, nii et masinanimed vastavad konteineritele. Env() hoiab SWARM_NAME impordikindel; peamine() jõustab seda jooksuajal."

# libretranslate
msgid "Node names come from `default.env` (`INFINITO_SWARM_*_NAME`) with the `SWARM_NAME` prefix. `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS` feeds `derive_includes` to select the active variant; in-process callers pass the map as `derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)`."
msgstr "Sõlmenimed pärinevad `default.env` (`INFINITO_SWARM_*_NAME`) koos `SWARM_NAME` eesliide. `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS` toidab `derive_includes` aktiivse variandi valimiseks; protsessisisesed helistajad läbivad kaardi `derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)`."

