# libretranslate
msgid "On Windows, use [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) as the development environment and run the repository commands inside WSL2, not directly in [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Use Ubuntu 24.04 with [Docker Desktop WSL2 integration](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), enable [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), and expect a few Windows-specific follow-up steps around [certificate authority (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) trust and local name resolution."
msgstr "Windowsis, kasuta [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) arenduskeskkonnana ja hoidla käskude käitamiseks WSL-i sees2, mitte otse [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Kasutage Ubuntu . 24.04 koos [Dockeri töölaua WSL2 integratsiooni](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), võimaldada [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), ja oodata mõningaid Windowsi-spetsiifilisi järelmeetmeid [sertifitseerimisasutus (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) usaldus ja kohaliku nime resolutsioon."

