msgid "Replace `hosted_only` with `unreviewed_third_party`. The review ran and selected no module. Odoo SA publishes no server and the OCA organisation holds no MCP repository, so the field is third-party only. The leading candidate, `ivnvxd/mcp-server-odoo` at `v0.8.0`, fails on maintenance breadth (197 of 231 commits from one author), on access control that ships as a separate Odoo Apps store module outside any pinnable tag, and on a mutating default tool scope. Re-review if Odoo SA or the OCA publishes a server."
msgstr ""

msgid "Replace `hosted_only`. Pin the official WordPress MCP adapter, expose its HTTP endpoint, register only reviewed Abilities with permission callbacks, and authenticate as a real restricted user through Application Password or proven OAuth."
